  "bodyHash": "9ca394e4acac35b2",
  "content": "\n\n<p>这是一个附属模组，用于&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-ore-excavation\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Ore Excavation</a>，旨在让通过钻头获取钻石和绿宝石变得更加困难。这样做是因为原版机制有些过于强大。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>将粗绿宝石和粗钻石转化为普通绿宝石和钻石的步骤如下：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span>1. 将粗钻石与 50mB 流体混合，得到加热粗钻石或钻石粉。<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AhMH6Zj.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"728\" height=\"428\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span>1.5 使用 16 份钻石粉合成粗钻石</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/S867Pxk.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"732\" height=\"432\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>2. 对加热粗钻石进行水洗，得到水洗粗钻石</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sWLxlgs.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"729\" height=\"306\"><br>3. 对水洗粗钻石进行切割，得到切割粗钻石</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ph4bGBt.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"740\" height=\"311\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>4. 对切割粗钻石进行压制，得到压制粗钻石</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oZIZ7wb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"742\" height=\"312\"><br>5. 对压制粗钻石进行抛光，得到钻石<br></span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jHWph32.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"744\" height=\"255\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>将粗红石转化为普通红石的流程也略有调整：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>1. 粉碎粗红石</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ssdJpbe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"741\" height=\"433\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>2. 向粉碎后的红石中添加 100mB 的水</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/meSCZLe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"740\" height=\"312\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>下界合金的处理方式则略有不同：<br></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span>1. 使用钻头处理粗下界合金碎块</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hvros7o.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"728\" height=\"422\"><br>2. 灼烧粗下界合金碎块，得到灼烧下界合金碎块</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ezb6xBY.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"738\" height=\"310\"><br>3. 对灼烧下界合金碎块进行附灵，得到附灵粗下界合金碎块</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KEuPGLS.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"734\" height=\"310\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>4. 烟熏附灵粗下界合金碎块，得到烧结下界合金碎块</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mc7MeLo.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"733\" height=\"311\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>5. 将烧结下界合金碎块与熔岩混合，得到熔岩下界合金碎块</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SOZ6Pf8.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"729\" height=\"430\"><br>6. 泼洒熔岩下界合金碎块，得到下界合金碎块</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XYm7Crz.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"733\" height=\"307\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>新增了通过压制下界合金碎块和金锭制作下界合金锭的功能。<br><br>要开采下界合金，你必须使用终极钻头，其合成方式如下：<br></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Y4oeDLq.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"729\" height=\"445\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;你现在还可以使用流体提取器从主世界和下界中提取熔岩。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
